{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>API.Error</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"elpi","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Elpi","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"API","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Error","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-t.component\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.component\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>component : string;</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>who found the error, eg <code>Typechecker</code></p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-t.loc\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.loc\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>loc : <span><a href=\"../Ast/Loc/index.html#type-t\">Ast.Loc.t</a> option</span>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.message\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.message\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>message : string;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>An error: of the parser, of a pass of the compiler, of the runtime, of the builtins...</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pp\"><a href=\"#val-pp\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pp : <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Format.formatter <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>location:</code> then, on the next line, <code>Component: message</code></p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pp_message\"><a href=\"#val-pp_message\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pp_message : <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Format.formatter <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>location:</code> then, on the next line, <code>Component: message</code></p><p><code>Component: message</code>, for who shows the location separately</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-show\"><a href=\"#val-show\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> show : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>Component: message</code>, for who shows the location separately</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type extension anchored\" id=\"extension-decl-ElpiError\"><a href=\"#extension-decl-ElpiError\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> exn += <span class=\"keyword\">private</span> </span></code><ol><li id=\"extension-ElpiError\" class=\"def variant extension anchored\"><a href=\"#extension-ElpiError\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"extension\">ElpiError</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></li></ol></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Raised by the builtins and the runtime, and by the passes of the compiler when <code>flags.max_errors</code> is 0 (the default): the first error. It is private: it is raised with <code>error</code></p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-error\"><a href=\"#val-error\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> error : <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?component</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?loc</span>:<a href=\"../Ast/Loc/index.html#type-t\">Ast.Loc.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>error ?component ?loc message</code> raises <code>ElpiError</code></p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-warning_id\"><a href=\"#type-warning_id\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> warning_id</span><span> = </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-warning_id.LinearVariable\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-warning_id.LinearVariable\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">LinearVariable</span></span></code></li><li id=\"type-warning_id.UndeclaredGlobal\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-warning_id.UndeclaredGlobal\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">UndeclaredGlobal</span></span></code></li><li id=\"type-warning_id.FlexClause\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-warning_id.FlexClause\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">FlexClause</span></span></code></li><li id=\"type-warning_id.ImplicationPrecedence\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-warning_id.ImplicationPrecedence\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">ImplicationPrecedence</span></span></code></li><li id=\"type-warning_id.NestedAccumulate\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-warning_id.NestedAccumulate\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">NestedAccumulate</span></span></code></li></ol></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The kinds of warnings</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-warning\"><a href=\"#type-warning\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> warning</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-warning.warning_id\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-warning.warning_id\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>warning_id : <a href=\"#type-warning_id\">warning_id</a>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-warning.warning\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-warning.warning\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>warning : <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a>;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-warning_name\"><a href=\"#val-warning_name\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> warning_name : <span><a href=\"#type-warning_id\">warning_id</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The name of a kind of warnings, in kebab-case (e.g. <code>linear-variable</code>), and back</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-warning_of_name\"><a href=\"#val-warning_of_name\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> warning_of_name : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-warning_id\">warning_id</a> option</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-all_warnings\"><a href=\"#val-all_warnings\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> all_warnings : <span><a href=\"#type-warning_id\">warning_id</a> list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>all the kinds of warnings</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-warning_level\"><a href=\"#type-warning_level\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> warning_level</span><span> = </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-warning_level.Off\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-warning_level.Off\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Off</span></span></code></li><li id=\"type-warning_level.On\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-warning_level.On\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">On</span></span></code></li><li id=\"type-warning_level.As_error\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-warning_level.As_error\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">As_error</span></span></code></li></ol></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>What to do with a kind of warnings: nothing, show it (the default), or make it an error</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-warning_spec\"><a href=\"#val-warning_spec\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> warning_spec : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>(<a href=\"#type-warning_id\">warning_id</a> * <a href=\"#type-warning_level\">warning_level</a>)</span> list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>warning_spec s</code> are the levels given by a spec of one kind of warnings: <code>+name</code> turns it on, <code>-name</code> off, <code>@name</code> makes it an error; <code>all</code> names all the kinds (e.g. <code>-linear-variable</code>, <code>@all</code>). Raises an <a href=\"#extension-ElpiError\"><code>ElpiError</code></a></p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-warning_level\"><a href=\"#val-warning_level\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> warning_level : \u000A  <span><span><span>(<a href=\"#type-warning_id\">warning_id</a> * <a href=\"#type-warning_level\">warning_level</a>)</span> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-warning_id\">warning_id</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"#type-warning_level\">warning_level</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>warning_level levels id</code>, the level of <code>id</code>: the last one given in <code>levels</code>, <code>On</code> if none</p></div></div>"}